  studies [answered (rules)] sector=buildings region=greece+eu
  "1 study matches sector Buildings, region Greece or EU. From your message: sector Buildings (“Buildings”). Type a change, such as another country or a topic."
> what's an NDC?
  answer [answered (rules)] Nationally Determined Contribution (NDC)
  "A Nationally Determined Contribution (NDC) is a country's climate pledge under the Paris Agreement, setting out its emission-reduction targets and actions. In I"
