  "Which variable do you mean? These are the closest matches; search for others."
> is that a forecast?
  answer [answered (rules)] Projections, not forecasts
  "IAM results are scenario projections, not forecasts. Each scenario shows what would happen if its assumptions held (policies, technology costs, population, econ"
